    </div>

    <div class="product-card">
      <div class="product-icon" style="background:rgba(15,52,96,.3)">⚡</div>
      <h3>火斗轻模</h3>
      <p class="tagline">自研0.5B小模型 · 私有化部署 数据不出域</p>
      <div class="price">¥0 <span>/年起</span></div>
      <ul class="features">
        <li>0.5B参数，CPU即可运行</li>
        <li>GGUF量化，q4_0仅336MB</li>
        <li>私有化部署，支持本地/内网/边缘</li>
